/Next 1222 0 R
>>
endobj
1227 0 obj
<<
/Title (UNDP's blog series on women and climate adaptation in Africa similarly documents that in Kenya, women produce up to eighty percent of the country's food, yet continue to struggle to secure financing, climate-smart technology and land titles necessary to convert their labor and knowledge into durable resilience \(UNDP, 2025\).)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1223 0 R
/Next 1232 0 R
>>
endobj
